The payments table stores information about payments, including the invoice ID, payment method, amount, and payment date.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| id | SERIAL | Unique identifier for the payment |
| invoice_id | INTEGER | Foreign key referencing the invoices table |
| payment_method | VARCHAR(100) | Payment method |
| amount | DECIMAL(10, 2) | Payment amount |
| payment_date | DATE | Payment date |